OL,3,AGoogle says services recovering after
OL,4,Acloud outage hits UK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,7,Frecovering after a "power event" at its
OL,8,FUK cloud site caused an outage
OL,9,Faffecting UK banks, businesses and the
OL,10,Fcourts.
OL,12,FThe company, one of a few large cloud
OL,13,Fcomputing firms whose infrastructure
OL,14,Fand services underpin many online
OL,15,Fplatforms, reported an "issue with
OL,16,Fmultiple services" at its London data
OL,17,Fcentre complex "europe-west2."
OL,19,FRevolut, Lloyds Bank and HSBC confirmed
OL,20,Fdisruption to some services on Tuesday
OL,21,Fmorning, after thousands of reports of
OL,22,Fproblems were raised by users online.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
