OL,3,AGoogle says services recovering after
OL,4,Acloud outage hits UK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the banks did not directly link
OL,7,Fthe issues to the Google Cloud outage,
OL,8,Fthe company has apologised "to all who
OL,9,Fare affected by the disruption".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
