OL,3,AUK asks Apple to widen access to its
OL,4,Apayment tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple maintains that widening access
OL,7,Fcould undermine security, and that its
OL,8,Fcurrent arrangements do not stop
OL,9,Finnovation.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
